{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"reference:f0d1846a3941889e","name":"Revolutionary Talent Tree","source":{"id":"source:reference-f0d1846a3941889e","title":"Revolutionary Talent Tree","revision":21239,"timestamp":"2024-08-26T01:24:53Z","sha256":"57d910be8958c328c8c2e3c1578fe49931c391167ca7094bf0a17a37a86acab3","url":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?oldid=21239","history":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?title=Revolutionary%20Talent%20Tree&action=history"},"article":{"sourceId":"source:reference-f0d1846a3941889e","blocks":[{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Galaxy of Intrigue"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Galaxy_of_Intrigue"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["You seek to overthrow the system and are adept at being a monkey wrench in the cogs of society, but often at the cost of others' rights, freedoms, and lives.\n"]},"\n\n",{"tag":"h2","children":["Core Talents"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Bomb Thrower"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Prerequisite:"]}," ",{"tag":"a","children":["Trained"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Trained"}," in ",{"tag":"a","children":["Mechanics"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Mechanics","referenceId":"reference:1c74a0e2ceaaeb28"},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["You are skilled in making and handling impromptu ",{"tag":"a","children":["Explosives"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Explosives"},". You gain a +5 bonus to ",{"tag":"a","children":["Mechanics"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Mechanics","referenceId":"reference:1c74a0e2ceaaeb28"}," checks to ",{"tag":"a","children":["Handle Explosives"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Handle_Explosives"},". In addition, you can spend a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Full-Round Action"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Full-Round_Action"}," to craft the equivalent of a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Frag Grenade"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Frag_Grenade","referenceId":"reference:5d38df4b2da8b77e"}," from spare parts you have on hand. You must have access to the appropriate supplies, such as an old blaster, a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Tool Kit"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Tool_Kit","referenceId":"reference:b833f332464890b5"},", or materials found inside a hangar bay.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["For the Cause"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Prerequisite:"]}," ",{"tag":"b","children":["Make an Example"]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["Whenever you or an ally within 6 squares of you takes damage that exceeds that character's ",{"tag":"a","children":["Damage Threshold"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Damage_Threshold"},", you and all allies within 6 squares of you gain a +2 bonus to attack rolls and damage rolls until the end of your next turn.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Make an Example"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":["Whenever you hit with an attack and deal enough damage to exceed a target's ",{"tag":"a","children":["Damage Threshold"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Damage_Threshold"},", that target takes a -5 penalty to attack rolls against you until the end of your next turn. This is a Mind-Affecting effect.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Revolutionary Rhetoric"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":["As a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Standard Action"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Standard_Action"},", you can do or say something that causes an enemy to doubt its motives. Choose one enemy within 12 squares and in your ",{"tag":"a","children":["Line of Sight"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Line_of_Sight","referenceId":"reference:7ae5eaf79143552f"},", and make a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Persuasion"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Persuasion","referenceId":"reference:196fbdc5f1823320"}," check against the target’s ",{"tag":"a","children":["Will Defense"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Will_Defense"},". If you succeed, the target can take only ",{"tag":"a","children":["Move Actions"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Move_Actions"}," and ",{"tag":"a","children":["Swift Actions"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Swift_Actions"}," until the end of your next turn. This effect ends if you attack the target. This is a Mind-Affecting effect.\n"]},"\n","\n","\n","\n\n","\n\n","\n"]}}
